<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24640" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διά-γνωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>distinguishing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δ. ποιεῖσθαι ὁποῖοι ἐκράτουν ἢ
					ἐκρατοῦντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.50
				</span></i>
			; <i>means of distinguishing</i> or <i>discerning,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				926
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλῶν ἢ μὴ τοιούτων τίς δ.;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.128
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. φωνῆς καὶ σιγῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Cael.</u>
					290b27
				</span></i>
			; of medical <i>diagnosis,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VC</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.766
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>power of discernment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				696
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>resolving, deciding,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					6.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταχίστην ἔχει δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					1.34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ὃ πρακτέον ἐστίν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Metrod.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῆς ἀξίας ποιεῖσθαι</span>
			to <i>determine</i> the value, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				865c
			</span></i>; = Lat. <i>cognitio,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Act.Ap.
				25.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				19i20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				891r24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ διαγνώσεων
				τοῦ Σεβαστοῦ,</span>
			= Lat. <i>a cognitionibus Augusti,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				14.1072
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ephes.</u>
				3
			</span></i> No.<i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
